{"displayStem":"같은 환자가 연속 시행한 두 호기 곡선이다. 두 회 모두 시작이 빠르고 첫 1초에 기침은 없었다. 가는 환자가 자의로 입을 떼어 2초에 종료했고, 나는 충분히 호기하여 말단 평형에 도달했다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 독립 작성 모의자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c10-visual\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"호기 시작 후 시간 (s)와 누적 호기 용적 (L)\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">반복 측정</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"49\">누적 호기 용적 (L)</text><path d=\"M70 60V260H490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M70 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M280 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"280\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M490 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"490\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><path d=\"M65 260h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M65 160h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.5</text><path d=\"M65 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><polyline points=\"70,260 83.125,220 96.25,192 122.5,172 175,156\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"260\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"83.125\" cy=\"220\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"96.25\" cy=\"192\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"122.5\" cy=\"172\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"156\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"80\" y=\"313\">━ 가</text><polyline points=\"70,260 83.125,220 96.25,192 122.5,172 175,140 280,108 385,100 437.5,100 490,100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"260\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></